   211	
   212	        The sort is read-time, in Python, through :func:`atoms.totalize` — the
   213	        one definition of the sort key in the tree. The SQL is ``ORDER BY rowid
   214	        ASC LIMIT ?`` and nothing else: an ``ORDER BY json_extract(...)`` here
   215	        would be a second, independently-drifting spelling of ``ByKey``. There
   216	        is no index for ``K``, by ruling; adding one is a later optimization a
   217	        benchmark has to justify.
   218	
   219	        ``ByKey(K)`` resolves ``K`` through :func:`atoms.resolve_key_field` —
