     2	
     3	The `lens` area pins the READ LENS: the declared projection a combine vertex
     4	reads its members under. Fold order is receipt order (`rowid ASC`), which is
     5	per-store; a combine vertex has no receipt axis across members, so a combined
     6	read must name the key it orders by.
