    15	  the properties that used to be replay concerns: ties on `ts` break by fact
    16	  `id` ascending, and sub-millisecond `ts` deltas survive storage and still
    17	  order the lens. These vectors are frozen normative artifacts; their
    18	  expected order still comes from the production combined read
    19	  (`vertex_facts`), with `totalize` asserted to agree.
    20	- `ByKey(<payload field>)` — projections under a declared payload key,
    21	  including the adversarial postures the primitive rules on: a record missing
    22	  K is not in the projection, equal K breaks by id ascending, and mixed key
    23	  types are refused.
