   471	        ``following`` pins the append to the head the ceremony reconciled
   472	        against: a record another writer lands mid-ceremony REFUSES the
   473	        append before any byte is written (``AppendRejected``), the
   474	        caller's transaction rolls back with the log byte-identical, and
   475	        the ceremony is simply retryable — unlike :meth:`_write`, this path
